+# Another TV — Player Pop preview
+
+This native Android build is a separate, remote-first preview of Another IPTV.
+Its application id is `dev.android.anotheriptvplayer.tvpreview`, so it can be
+installed next to another build without replacing it.
+
+## Included in 0.1
+
+- Android TV / Google TV launcher entry and Player Pop compatibility
+- premium dark home with hero, catalog rails and visible D-pad focus
+- Live, Movies and Series catalog navigation
+- Continue Watching and local, private recommendations
+- New Episodes button, unread badge and an expandable notification drawer
+- automatic catalog refresh baseline (at most once every six hours)
+- existing Xtream, playback, favorites, history and offline-download plumbing
+- accent-insensitive title, actor and director search when metadata is available
+- remote microphone search with French/English auto-switch on Android 14+
+- French and English TV labels
+- parallel catalog synchronization for shorter refreshes
+- safer resumable downloads and redacted IPTV credentials in logs
+
+The new-episode feed uses Xtream's `last_modified` value. Some providers do not
+update that field reliably, so the preview deliberately says “update detected”
+instead of inventing an episode number.
+
+## Free build
+
+Run the `Native Android TV · Preview APK` GitHub Actions workflow. It produces a
+debug-signed `app-debug.apk`; debug signing is free and is enough for sideloading.
+No Play Store account or paid certificate is required.
+
+For a local build:
+
+```bash
+make -C apps/android/Vendor/libmpv-android
+cd apps/android
+./gradlew testDebugUnitTest assembleDebug
+```
+
+The APK is written to:
+
+```text
+apps/android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
+```
+
+## Install on Freebox Player Pop
+
+Enable installation from unknown sources for the file-manager app used on the
+Player Pop, copy the APK through a USB drive or a trusted local transfer tool,
+then open it and confirm installation. A future preview can add in-app update
+delivery; 0.1 intentionally keeps distribution simple and account-free.
+
+## Planned after the first TV preview
+
+- translated-title aliases and richer fuzzy search from an external metadata source
+- richer detail, settings, downloads and playlist screens for the remote
+- optional self-hosted profile sync between iPhone, iPad and TV
+- external ranking sources for genuine France/world charts
+- broader codec/device testing and release signing for seamless upgrades
